history.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept.
Create ONE square cute CHIBI PIXEL-ART game illustration: a happy baby pig LICKING an ice cream cone. This is a NEW composition, fully standalone, not a sheet or comparison.
A single adorable PEACH baby pig sits front-facing in the center, very large head and tiny round body. Plump cheeks, small rounded folded pig ears, large round BLACK eyes each with ONE LARGE WHITE highlight block, a large soft peach oval pig snout with two ROSE nostrils, rosy cheek patches, delighted expression. Give it excellent charming baby-animal proportions and expressive eyes.
Both peach front trotters cup ONE BIG SOLID BROWN cone in front of belly. One LARGE WHITE scoop on top, ONE TINY RED cherry on the very top. A short ROSE tongue comes out of its small smiling mouth and TOUCHES the side of the white ice cream, unmistakably licking it. Clearly separate mouth, snout and ice cream so they read at small size. Keep the entire animal in the picture: pig ears inside canvas, pig body/feet go down to and TOUCH the BOTTOM EDGE, no empty margin below body. Two round feet at bottom corners of its body. The big unified pig-and-cone silhouette fills 55-56% of entire canvas, spans most canvas width and nearly full height.
Background completely uniform PALE PINK #FFC5E0. Bold simple BLACK character outlines, clear continuous silhouettes, readable features. White scoop and brown cone are simple solid silhouettes without waffle texture or highlights. One ice cream and one character only, no furniture, ground, decorations, hearts, stars, crumbs, sparkles, extra props, lettering or watermark.
Art: real chunky 60x60 logical pixel-art with large square blocks and hard axis-aligned stair-step contours, enlarged cleanly. Flat solid fills only, NO gradients, shading, texture, glow, antialias blur or tiny details. Avoid thin hairline contour gaps. NOT a smooth vector drawing and NOT 3D.
ONLY these SEVEN ink colors, total area means WHOLE square including background:
#FFC5E0 pale-pink background approximately44% (aim44-46%);
#FFCAA9 peach pig approximately26% (aim27-29%);
#65392D brown cone MAX10%;
#FFFFFF white scoop plus eye highlights MAX8%;
#2D2D2D charcoal outlines, eyes and smile MAX7%;
#9C225E rose nostrils, cheek blush and tiny tongue MAX2%;
#FF525B coral-red tiny cherry MAX1% (only a few cells).
The approximate percentages have rounding slack: keep all MAX limits strictly and distribute the remaining area across pink/peach. Do NOT enlarge black eyes or outline so much that black exceeds7%. White eye glints count toward8% along with scoop. Foreground must occupy OVER50% ofcanvas. Fully opaque square.
Variant26: pig upright with a wonderfully round cheeky face, two symmetric small ears, big sparkling round eyes looking toward the scoop. Cone in front and slightly to the pig's right, small tongue touching left side of the scoop. Happy and sweet. Big snout remains clearly visible to left of scoop.

